      "Inclusivity: Featuring a wide range of demographics (urban professionals, rural families, students) ensures the campaign resonates with a broad audience, enhancing its appeal.",
      "Positive Messaging: Focusing on 'victory' and 'success' ties the brand to positive outcomes, potentially boosting consumer perception of Nestlé products as essential to achieving daily goals.",
      "Relatability: By showcasing diverse morning routines, the campaign can effectively connect with viewers' own experiences, making the message more relatable and engaging."
