    "Weaknesses": [
      "Product Focus Clarity: While the campaign highlights the importance of starting the day right, it may not clearly communicate how specific Nestlé products contribute to this success, risking a diluted brand message.",
      "Overemphasis on Morning: By focusing solely on morning routines, the campaign might miss opportunities to position Nestlé products as integral throughout the day, potentially limiting product appeal.",
      "Cultural Sensitivity: The campaign must navigate diverse cultural perceptions of 'victory' and 'success' within Paraguay carefully to avoid alienating segments of the target audience."
    ]
  },
